# Not needed at runtime, and uploading it costs build time and deploy size.
#
# Kept deliberately narrow: Vercel applies these patterns to the whole clone, not
# just the Root Directory, and an earlier version of this file listed `analysis/`
# and `*.md`, which matched the audit repository's own analysis/ folder and
# ANALYSIS.md at the repo root and removed 96 files from the deployment. Harmless,
# but it meant a file scoped to the app was editing the repo around it.
scripts/
docs/
data/
.vercel/
*.log
